Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 09:27:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Harden lifetime pause observer admission and retries

Address independent review: reload auto-continue config per iteration, skip skewed runtimes, retain observer after scan/config failures, and exponentially back off unscheduled attempts to 300s with a warning. Existing at-most-once and stop guards remain unchanged. Five new guard cases and all 23 startup-resume consumer files pass; full scripts/check passes.
---
